sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant PC as AuthorPostController
    participant PS as PostService
    participant PR as PostRepository
    participant CC as CategoryClient
    participant DB as MySQL (post_db)
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant RD as Redis

    Note over FE,RD: Create & Publish Post Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/posts/author/ + Bearer Token
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT, check AUTHOR role
    GW->>PC: Forward with X-User-Id, X-Username
    PC->>PS: createPost(request, principal)
    PS->>PS: HtmlSanitizer.sanitize(content)
    PS->>PS: SlugUtil.createSlug(title)
    PS->>PS: ReadTimeUtil.calculate(content)
    PS->>PR: save(post)
    PR->>DB: INSERT INTO posts
    DB-->>PR: saved
    PS->>CC: syncTaxonomy(postId, categories, tags)
    CC-->>PS: OK
    PS-->>PC: PostResponse
    PC-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,RD: Publish Post
    FE->>GW: PATCH /api/posts/author/{id}/publish
    GW->>PC: Forward
    PC->>PS: publishPost(id, principal)
    PS->>PR: findById(id)
    PR->>DB: SELECT
    PS->>PS: verify author owns post
    PS->>PR: save(post with status=PUBLISHED)
    PR->>DB: UPDATE
    PS->>RMQ: send("post.published", payload)
    PS->>RD: evict cache
    PS-->>PC: PostResponse
    PC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,RD: Public Read with Caching
    FE->>GW: GET /api/posts/public/{slug}
    GW->>PC: Forward (public path)
    PC->>RD: Check cache
    alt Cache hit
        RD-->>PC: cached PostResponse
    else Cache miss
        PC->>PS: getBySlug(slug)
        PS->>PR: findBySlug(slug)
        PR->>DB: SELECT
        PS->>PS: incrementViewCount()
        PS-->>PC: PostResponse
        PC->>RD: Store in cache
    end
    PC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Response
